### Sprint 1 - Foundations & Core APIs (Sep 25 - Oct 19)

---

##  Objective
Explore and evaluate NLP models for **Named Entity Recognition (NER)** on raw email text to extract:
- **People names (PER)**
- **Organizations (ORG)**
- **Temporal expressions (dates/times)**

This will form the foundation for integrating automatic task creation (Google Calendar / Todoist) in future sprints.

---

##  Features

 Compare multiple Hugging Face NER models
 Evaluate with a small labeled ground truth (precision / recall / F1)
 Test multilingual (English + Spanish) examples
 Detect temporal expressions using `dateparser.search`
 Generate structured task outputs ready for API integration

---
 
